    "closedCorrections": [
      "The single-owner IAQ contract now emits two policy projections with exact field, filter, sort, cursor, action-suppression and scope-reset invariants.",
      "PDX-008 projection no longer accepts caller-declared direction, intent, execution identity, population authority or source proof; only owner-issued opaque contexts reach public projection methods.",
      "Canonical colon references interoperate across G2 and PDX while URL, path, query, fragment, cross-binding, provider-receipt and compensation substitutions fail closed.",
      "The egress boundary denies private, metadata, carrier-grade NAT and IPv6 ULA ranges and detects redirect or DNS-rebinding changes.",
      "V269 route-owner and binding inserts are exactly idempotent, full-tuple drift fails closed, and real PostgreSQL verifies clean install, V268 upgrade, reapply no-op and transaction rollback.",
      "MASK, OMIT, stale, partial, unavailable and denied evidence cannot retain command actions.",
      "The frontend contract is unmounted, default OFF and imported nowhere outside its own directory."
    ]
